# Cloudflare Pages redirects (consolidated 2026-07-29)
# Format: [source] [destination] [status]
# Lower-priority static-file rules MUST come last (Cloudflare evaluates in order).
# CF Pages serves /404.html automatically for any non-matching path, so an explicit
# 404 catch-all here would be redundant.

# /blog/ → /tutorials/ — remove duplicate-content SEO signal
/blog    /tutorials    301
/blog/   /tutorials/   301
/zh/blog /zh/tutorials 301
/zh/blog/ /zh/tutorials/ 301

# Legacy /en/ paths (the /en/ prefix was a previous EN locale convention; we
# now use root paths per Astro i18n routing prefixDefaultLocale: false).
# Wildcard in CF _redirects takes priority over static files in /dist/en/.
/en/tutorials/anthropic-claude-api-review    /tutorials/anthropic-claude-api-review    301
/en/tutorials/anthropic-claude-api-review/   /tutorials/anthropic-claude-api-review/   301
/en/*    /:splat    301
/zh/en/*    /:splat    301